<title>NETHERLANDS: ENHOBEL FIRST-HALF NET SLIGHTLY UP.</title>
<headline>ENHOBEL FIRST-HALF NET SLIGHTLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Direct inv result (net profit)   2.7  vs   2.6</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 0.80 vs   n.a.</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (gldrs)     24.53 vs  23.77*</p>
<p>*NOTE - comparative figure for asset value at end-1995.</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment fund Engels-Hollandse Beleggings Trust NV</p>
<p>(Enhobel) said it expected the 1996 full-year direct investment</p>
<p>result to be higher than five million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
